{"id":"eaeefe0a6812ba97","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-cantor-normal-form.md","title":"Cantor Normal Form","display":"df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-cantor-normal-form","aliases":["72-df-cantor-normal-form"],"display":"df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.1; print210–214; PDF222–226; Cantor-normal-form existence/uniqueness argument","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-cantor-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-cantor-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.1; print210–214; PDF222–226; Cantor-normal-form existence/uniqueness argument"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:k\\to\\alpha+1\">\\(b:k\\to\\alpha+1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:k\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(c:k\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 为有限函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。有限序数和按下标递增顺序计算，空和为0。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}\">\\(\\operatorname{deg}\\)</span> 是下式定义在序数上的类函数；无穷类仅作元语言参数域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 表示序数真类。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\operatorname{dom}(c)=k\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ (c_i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\ (b_j&lt;b_i)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\omega^{b_i}\\cdot c_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\operatorname{dom}(c)=k\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ (c_i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\ (b_j&lt;b_i)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\omega^{b_i}\\cdot c_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}(\\alpha):=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;\\alpha=0,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha+1\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists b\\in(\\alpha+1)^k\\ \\exists c\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\ (\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\land\\beta=b_0),&amp;\\alpha&gt;0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{deg}(\\alpha):=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;\\alpha=0,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha+1\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists b\\in(\\alpha+1)^k\\ \\exists c\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\ (\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\land\\beta=b_0),&amp;\\alpha&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 IV 章 §1.1 的 Cantor 正规形。标准存在性证明反复取最大ω幂及有限正系数；余项的首指数严格下降，序数良基性使过程有限终止。若两种表示首个不同项的指数或系数不同，较小尾项严格小于相应ω幂，不能抵消差异，故正规形唯一。该唯一性确保非零分支的ι有唯一见证；零分支不访问不存在的b0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"b:k\\to\\alpha+1","display":false},{"tex":"c:k\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\operatorname{dom}(c)=k\\land\\forall i<k\\ (c_i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land\\forall i<j<k\\ (b_j<b_i)\\land\\alpha=\\sum_{i<k}\\omega^{b_i}\\cdot c_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}(\\alpha):=\\begin{cases}0,&\\alpha=0,\\\\\\iota\\beta\\in\\alpha+1\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\exists b\\in(\\alpha+1)^k\\ \\exists c\\in(\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})^k\\ (\\mathrm{CNF}(\\alpha;b,c)\\land\\beta=b_0),&\\alpha>0.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"0834bea6989e10f4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-cantor-normal-form|df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form](72-df-cantor-normal-form.md)"},{"id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-cantor-normal-form|df-cantor-normal-form — Cantor Normal Form]]"},{"id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-cantor-normal-form]]"}],"outgoing":[]}